    command = "RJ"+"A"+J1Val+"B"+J2Val+"C"+J3Val+"D"+J4Val+"E"+J5Val+"F"+J6Val+"J7"+J7Val+"J8"+J8Val+"J9"+J9Val+speedPrefix+Speed+"Ac"+ACCspd+"Dc"+DECspd+"Rm"+ACCramp+"W"+RUN['WC']+"Lm"+LoopMode+"\n"
